{"sections":[{"slug":"泛闭映射","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"泛闭映射"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">泛闭映射</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"泛闭映射"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的映射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <strong><span lang=\"zh\">泛闭</span></strong> (universally closed) <span lang=\"zh\">是指对任意</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/基变换","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">基变换</span>"}},{"Plain":" $Y'\\to Y$, $f'\\colon X\\times_Y Y' \\to Y'$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/闭映射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">闭映射</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">赋值判别法</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">为概形的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟紧态射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟紧映射</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">泛闭当且仅当</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/赋值判别法","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">赋值判别法</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的存在性部分</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即对任意</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/赋值环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">赋值环</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">及其分式域</span> $K$, <span lang=\"zh\">提升问题</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccc}\r\n    \\operatorname{Spec}K &amp; \\to &amp; X\\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\n    \\operatorname{Spec}A &amp; \\to &amp; Y\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">总</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">存在</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">至少一个解</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>$\\mathbb A^1_k \\to \\operatorname{Spec}k$ <span lang=\"zh\">是闭映射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">不是</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">泛闭映射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">因为其基变换</span> $\\mathbb A^2_k \\to\\mathbb A^1_k$ <span lang=\"zh\">不是闭映射</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}